Unsupported features should appear inactive/dimmed rather than pretending they are available.

If a provider supports a capability, CNS should connect through that provider's supported interface.


---

13. 🧩 MEMORY IS NOT THE BRAIN

Memory is a separate CNS subsystem.

The model reasons.

CNS remembers.

This distinction must remain fundamental.

CNS MEMORY
                   │
       ┌───────────┼───────────┐
       │           │           │
     Model A     Model B     Model C
       │           │           │
   temporary    temporary   temporary
   reasoning    reasoning   reasoning

Changing the model must not erase CNS continuity.


---

14. PERSISTENT CNS AWARENESS

CNS should maintain continuity about:

What is currently happening

What has already happened

What still needs to happen

Which project is active

Which workflow is running

Which decisions were made

Relevant historical context

Agent/bot state

Research state

System state

User-approved preferences

Pending work


The purpose is not merely to store old conversations.

The goal is:

> CNS should understand its ongoing state and retrieve the relevant information when required.




