21. CRITICAL TRADING PRINCIPLE

LLMs must never become a single point of failure for deterministic trading safety.

The core trading system should independently control:

Market data

Strategy execution

Risk controls

Position limits

Portfolio logic

Order validation

Execution

Kill switch


An LLM can analyze, advise or orchestrate where permitted.

